[{"title":"送张大纲受职之京","author":"沈鍊","text":"公子文才出将门，赋诗长日坐江村。\n青云晓合三军策，华月晴开万里樽。\n长路关山赡北极，壮游江汉问真源。\n怜君早佩封侯印，玉帐题书入故园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23223,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简弟子京","author":"沈鍊","text":"北征冬尽下扬州，积雪疏花散石楼。\n此日飘零遥忆汝，长江浩荡不胜愁。\n仓皇乡土殊相慰，潦倒风尘总未休。\n安得万山深隐处，披云倚壑共冥搜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23224,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄骆容山","author":"沈鍊","text":"江树浃辰欢奉觏，江蓑转棹逐人哀。\n君今独啸王郎宅，我亦长歌伯禹台。\n世上风云谁可拟，山中物色尽兴猜。\n祇令共结兰亭社，醉倒花前白玉杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23225,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山游会周张二大尹同宴飞来山得峰字","author":"沈鍊","text":"交游时节幸过逢，更有仙台碧树重。\n地迥不厌倾斗酒，眼明偏是见高峰。\n云移隔浦开千嶂，人倚青天似二龙。\n闻道县庭公事简，暂教轩盖一从容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23226,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠冯子哲五十","author":"沈鍊","text":"仙客看花五十春，玳筵星发燕佳辰。\n玉杯斟酌长生酒，锦席昭回上德珍。\n舞近南山同献寿，歌随夜月总娱宾。\n愿君手植千章柏，记取年年祝颂新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23227,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贺岑山人新居","author":"沈鍊","text":"匡阜山居卜筑新，石楼云馆抱阳春。\n南州物色逢徐孺，谷口桃花对子真。\n驭气乘风元得驾，挥金吐玉底言贫。\n蜀都幸有扬雄赋，即遣朱车并日轮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23228,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠袁定山明府北上","author":"沈鍊","text":"羽骑登途本拔群，朱弦那用惜离分。\n三秋佐郡悬明月，千里趋庭奉白云。\n宛恋壶浆陈祖道，飘摇剑佩出河濆。\n祇令草就长杨赋，青琐遥持献圣君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23229,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送叶子肃文学游广陵","author":"沈鍊","text":"临分握手且躇蹰，雪驿寒晖尚未舒。\n君仗才名客吴地，好迎春律向江都。\n斗间气合双龙剑，梦里神符五岳书。\n别后瑶琴疏古调，可堪凉月夜堂虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23230,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题越望亭呈笃斋汤郡侯","author":"沈鍊","text":"重峦郁嵂俯崇城，绮榭初依巘道明。\n珠翼依空双凤起，玉螭承露九华生。\n上游日月攀将近，四面山河削不成。\n幸得欢游陪燕赏，秖将歌咏颂升平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23231,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"沈鍊","text":"冬夜银河永，清光入座频。\n遥知经绝域，不为照离人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23232,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻角","author":"沈鍊","text":"宝剑连星砺，龙韬带月寻。\n数声清角里，多少塞垣心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23233,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淮阴","author":"沈鍊","text":"哀饥曾进沙边饭，伏跨还输市上豪。\n举足重轻因恋汉，区区荣辱等秋毫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23234,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题孙君月池卷","author":"沈鍊","text":"明月照池边，澄平夕景连。\n山人临泛处，不异镜中仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23235,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏司马文正积德之什兼吊菲泉宪伯","author":"沈鍊","text":"佩符元祐日，弭节中兴年。\n司马多奇服，攀龙不异天。\n传家文未坠，省墓剑常悬。\n方驾成俱往，临云一怆然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23236,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽钱子道","author":"沈鍊","text":"仙翁回鹤驾，一日驭风归。\n为息人间辔，还忘月上机。\n上宾冠剑释，郎尹羽旄飞。\n盛德乌栖树，清光月照扉。\n独怜游子恨，还湿老莱衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23237,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沃洲吕侍御画四首 其一 江山岁晚","author":"沈鍊","text":"北风翻送雁南翔，辛苦时时一望乡。\n莫为无书远相忆，已将高节彻冰霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23238,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沃洲吕侍御画四首 其二 春江垂钓","author":"沈鍊","text":"春渚垂纶日出馀，落花流水溅衣裾。\n吕公既入非熊兆，犹向沧江忆钓鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23239,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沃洲吕侍御画四首 其三 溪塘秋晚","author":"沈鍊","text":"溪水泠泠玉露天，笛中声泛木兰船。\n莫教吹出阳关曲，不为悲秋已黯然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23240,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沃洲吕侍御画四首 其四 辋川积雨","author":"沈鍊","text":"王维习静更能诗，兴在空林积雨时。\n不厌苦吟生白发，自教阴木啭黄鹂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23241,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"五花骝马出龙城，一叶兰舟独自行。\n谁道维扬江上月，清光翻对水波平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23242,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"君今骑鹤上扬州，我是从军出陇头。\n何异济川河曲水，一时南北各分流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23243,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其三","author":"沈鍊","text":"明月娟娟横玉钩，御河西畔不胜秋。\n本因杨柳牵风动，误遣桃花逐水流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23244,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其四","author":"沈鍊","text":"支机织女渡河难，独有张骞去复还。\n近日乘槎河汉否，好传消息到人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23245,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其五","author":"沈鍊","text":"朝看玉魄绕枝柔，暮对清光傍叶流。\n何事楼头杨柳月，长年只在保安州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23246,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其六","author":"沈鍊","text":"何人见谪九江城，病里刘郎入骨惊。\n灯影徘徊心欲折，不堪风雨夜来声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23247,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其七","author":"沈鍊","text":"与君同作逐臣行，宣室终当召贾生。\n我似夜郎流李白，何时吹笛过江城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23248,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其八","author":"沈鍊","text":"解道秋风隔岸吹，早先吹断藕中丝。\n不曾看得郎骑马，何事能题骢马嘶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23249,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其十一","author":"沈鍊","text":"五凤楼边一疏来，含香抱玉夜徘徊。\n自甘书记还题竹，谁道司丞去咏梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23250,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其十二","author":"沈鍊","text":"平生胆略好封侯，夜读阴符晓未休。\n为问张华龙剑在，借余一斩月氐头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23251,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其十三","author":"沈鍊","text":"阁老宅中花树盛，会同河上酒卮香。\n欢游已共烟霞谢，意气知随山水长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23252,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其十四","author":"沈鍊","text":"三岁欢娱曾不足，一朝离别已伤多。\n海棠花畔听丝竹，无奈风光入眼何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23253,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其十五","author":"沈鍊","text":"自君之出不鸣琴，流水高山万里心。\n复道思君若流水，陇头呜咽到如今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23254,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张有功十六首 其十六","author":"沈鍊","text":"阮籍驱车空放达，贾生摇笔已滂沱。\n芙蓉枝上倾珠露，不是仙郎涕泪多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23255,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书怀二首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"山城六月草青青，万里羁人正独行。\n壮士不归头渐白，四方戈戟几时平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23256,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书怀二首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"秦关百二岸成池，旋转乾坤在此时。\n方叔壮猷元老卧，何人早赋中兴诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23257,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送张汝道","author":"沈鍊","text":"曾为县令气难驯，一卧丰城几树春。\n今日幸逢张仆射，肯将宝剑赠他人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23258,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日","author":"沈鍊","text":"风光二月柳垂丝，秖爱帘栊日影迟。\n寄语海棠休乱发，看花不是少年时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23259,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得濯足万里流赠谢宪伯","author":"沈鍊","text":"长江淼淼接银河，仙客乘秋濯素波。\n回首风烟如梦里，只教明月照渔蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23260,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边词 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"烽火何曾不暂惊，人民安堵太无情。\n鸳鸯绣出全无样，要与他家帖画屏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23261,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边词 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"十面埋兵擒项籍，三分割据愤曹操。\n忠臣报国心无尽，肯为家贫卖宝刀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23262,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边词 其三","author":"沈鍊","text":"塞上烟尘一万重，霍家营阵自从容。\n健儿夜半偷胡马，留作秋来夺获功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23263,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边词 其四","author":"沈鍊","text":"铁甲将军奋臂呼，一时箭镞满头颅。\n羌戎不是偏枭勇，知道无人救郭都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23264,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边词 其五","author":"沈鍊","text":"垂老军人发坠肩，焚香夜夜告苍天。\n愿留守将多年岁，省得重科见面钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23265,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"边词 其六","author":"沈鍊","text":"边陲本是宰臣庄，漫道年年散俸粮。\n但使将军科罚少，尽留衣食养儿郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23266,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"休贪百姓钱","author":"沈鍊","text":"世上江河流日下，官人索钱势可怕。\n吏兵二部日夜开，手里无钱口无话。\n权门贿赂已成渠，算来到底为痴愚。\n削皮吃血人受苦，瘦国肥家彼自如。\n聪明男子不爱钱，天生地化福无边。\n请君但看燃脐报，可是黄金坞内填。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23267,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"莫割平人首","author":"沈鍊","text":"边尘浩浩风吹急，塞上迁臣长泪滴。\n毛头星明太白高，朝来又报羌兵入。\n羌兵入来犹云可，汉兵杀人愁杀我。\n借问官军羞不羞，口里誇功心里忧。\n魂惊魄惧梦像恶，只为贪心强割头。\n曾不见荆轲义借于期首，犹死秦廷血迸流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23268,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"万里风云入虎牙，千金生縳夜鸣笳。\n谁知大将轻奇术，只是抠衣一左车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23269,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"匈奴百万未须忧，斩将搴旗在运筹。\n束发由来憎李广，不将辛苦觅封侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23270,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"塞上曲 其三","author":"沈鍊","text":"龙争虎斗海波翻，燕息干戈只一言。\n曹操小儿何足数，敢将轻骑猎中原。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23271,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得驾驭必英雄","author":"沈鍊","text":"汉高神武沛中兴，大沛风云欲上蒸。\n剑发赤精萧相举，书留黄石子房升。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23272,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送任子入都城","author":"沈鍊","text":"君去逢人在帝京，道余辛苦二毛生。\n梦中不觉为迁客，犹抱封书入凤城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23273,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴三首 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"雪叶霜花二月天，春风知不到三边。\n寒威直射重裘里，白发征人未拆绵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23274,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴三首 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"彗星夜见卜何祥，宝剑磨成杂耿光。\n不分匈奴长犯塞，誓心擒灭左贤王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23275,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴三首 其三","author":"沈鍊","text":"丹心恋主岁华惊，镜里飘飖白发生。\n谁为画成忧国恨，关西一片月长明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23276,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陆道庵","author":"沈鍊","text":"云树烟花隔水南，仙人羽服坐龙龛。\n丹书昨到斜阳里，正忆衡山陆道庵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23277,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金门候对图赠济川蔡进士","author":"沈鍊","text":"蔡泽应知晚出身，终当跃马走西秦。\n画工不是毛延寿，肯遣娥眉错嫁人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23278,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆高伯函","author":"沈鍊","text":"刀州一梦十年强，搔首关河泪几行。\n知己从来无觅处，天涯更欲断人肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23279,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆于山人","author":"沈鍊","text":"知己难逢最易分，朝来一片岭头云。\n虽然书札时常有，犹向衡阳忆雁群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23280,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游子吟","author":"沈鍊","text":"堂上老亲垂白发，天涯游子泪斑衣。\n何人解道山河险，梦里犹能夜夜归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23281,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆昔","author":"沈鍊","text":"河洲客梦思氤氲，画角声中晓色分。\n回首春风将十载，至今啼雁不堪闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23282,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞曲 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"中年曾作羽林郎，谁怕横飞塞上霜。\n自羡当年班定远，能将十骑斩贤王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23283,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出塞曲 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"生悬宝剑报君恩，自许青萍气不凡。\n若遣海波清未得，玉颜何用立乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23284,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗 其一","author":"沈鍊","text":"旷世栖灵岳，希心蹑大罗。\n手中元气合，足下白云多。\n洞口留丹色，岩深隐薜萝。\n犹闻尘世上，金鼓杂铙歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23285,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗 其二","author":"沈鍊","text":"好生明帝德，兼济是丹心。\n辟恶悬轩镜，调风鼓舜琴。\n皇天憎白发，大地足黄金。\n圣智参玄化，精研万古深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23286,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗 其三","author":"沈鍊","text":"玉液生真宰，金丹本缉熙。\n圣人悲独往，大化有真知。\n宝剑龙双合，瑶琴凤九仪。\n高台延绮烛，恒恐朔风吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23287,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗 其四","author":"沈鍊","text":"时哉圣所宝，气化错毫釐。\n真诀乾坤应，阴符日月随。\n壶中元化转，鼎上八风吹。\n惟有修真客，精诚永不移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23288,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗 其五","author":"沈鍊","text":"采薇西山客，即是紫芝仙。\n观世心不忍，入山身自然。\n大还周八极，小隐亦千年。\n谁云饥饿死，本以薄闳颠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23289,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗 其六","author":"沈鍊","text":"巍巍秋梁子，灵气在人间。\n混世安金鼎，和光驻玉颜。\n凤骖谁与并，龙驾讵能攀。\n拟落周唐际，真能炼九还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23290,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗 其七","author":"沈鍊","text":"延生非宝鼎，济世是金仙。\n炼就壶中药，遨游物外天。\n一身通宇宙，万化合人烟。\n区区龟鹤算，何足羡长年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23291,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗 其八","author":"沈鍊","text":"宝剑神仙制，寰中灏气多。\n双飞齐日月，一意斩妖魔。\n国纪乾坤正，军威将士和。\n从来太阿出，瀚海湛无波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23292,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗 其九","author":"沈鍊","text":"领得真灵诀，刚风扫世氛。\n严威凌万仞，正气肃三军。\n有道威时凤，无心出岫云。\n中虚纯一德，渺渺似离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23293,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游仙诗 其十","author":"沈鍊","text":"明自虚无谷，光生笃实天。\n壶中悬大象，镜外丽长川。\n尧舜非无术，伊周即是仙。\n雍熙调玉烛，和气正芊妍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":23294,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]